hange", "name": "PT101 变化更新脚本", "trigger": "on_change", "bound_tag": "PT101", "body": "// PT101 值变化时执行\nfunction on_change(new_value, old_value) {\n    // 在此处编写更新逻辑\n    log(\"PT101 changed from \" + old_value + \" to \" + new_value);\n    \n    // TODO: 添加您的自定义更新逻辑\n}"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"script_id": "script_pt101_onchange"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"scripts.script_pt101_onchange": {"id": "script_pt101_onchange", "name": "PT101 变化更新脚本", "trigger": "on_change", "bound_tag": "PT101", "period_s": null, "body": "// PT101 值变化时执行\nfunction on_change(new_value, old_value) {\n    // 在此处编写更新逻辑\n    log(\"PT101 changed from \" + old_value + \" to \" + new_value);\n    \n    // TODO: 添加您的自定义更新逻辑\n}", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.06049999501556158, "intended_entities": ["scripts.script_pt101_onchange"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT101"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:357b1ea6f5b4f87700cb9cd9dccba5ff591d39cf47620a7819d3c2f5f037d0a7", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26647, "output_tokens": 264, "latency_ms": 8502.78589996742, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为您创建一个绑定到 PT101 的 on_change 脚本。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a script that triggers when the tag \"PT101\" changes. This is an \"on_change\" trigger script bound to the tag \"PT101\".\n\nI have all the information needed:\n- trigger: \"on_change\"\n- bound_tag: \"PT101\"\n\nI need to generate a script ID and name. The user said \"update\" when PT101 changes, so I'll create an on_change script bound to PT101.\n\nLet me create the script."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26950, "output_tokens": 214, "latency_ms": 5280.355800001416, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 脚本已创建成功！\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **脚本 ID** | `script_pt101_onchange` |\n| **名称** | PT101 变化更新脚本 |\n| **触发类型** | `on_change`（值变化时触发） |\n| **绑定标签** | `PT101` |\n\n脚本已默认启用。当 **PT101** 的值发生变化时，系统会自动调用该脚本，并传入 `new_value` 和 `old_value` 两个参数。\n\n---\n\n📌 **下一步提示：**\n- 脚本体（`body`）目前是模板代码，您可以告诉我具体的更新逻辑，我来帮您完善脚本内容。\n- 例如：联动其他变量、触发报警、写入数据库等。\n\n需要我帮您补充具体的业务逻辑吗？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The script was created successfully. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53597, "output_tokens": 478, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13898.455300019123}, "judge": null}
