change", "name": "PT101变化触发脚本", "trigger": "on_change", "bound_tag": "PT101", "body": "// PT101 值变化时执行\n// 当前值可通过系统变量读取\nfunction onChange(newValue, oldValue) {\n    // 在此添加您的业务逻辑\n    log(\"PT101 值已变化: \" + oldValue + \" -> \" + newValue);\n    \n    // TODO: 添加自定义处理逻辑\n}"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"script_id": "script_pt101_on_change"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"scripts.script_pt101_on_change": {"id": "script_pt101_on_change", "name": "PT101变化触发脚本", "trigger": "on_change", "bound_tag": "PT101", "period_s": null, "body": "// PT101 值变化时执行\n// 当前值可通过系统变量读取\nfunction onChange(newValue, oldValue) {\n    // 在此添加您的业务逻辑\n    log(\"PT101 值已变化: \" + oldValue + \" -> \" + newValue);\n    \n    // TODO: 添加自定义处理逻辑\n}", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.05749997217208147, "intended_entities": ["scripts.script_pt101_on_change"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT101"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:15e80a24a66a9c78830a5953a72e8464420562f6a2845de74facb9f4edbd3ac7", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26647, "output_tokens": 199, "latency_ms": 9546.942100045271, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来创建一个当 PT101 标签变化时触发执行的脚本。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a script that executes when the PT101 tag changes. This is a typical \"on_change\" trigger script in SCADA."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26885, "output_tokens": 217, "latency_ms": 6110.875700018369, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "脚本已成功创建！以下是配置摘要：\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|------|\n| **脚本ID** | `script_pt101_on_change` |\n| **脚本名称** | PT101变化触发脚本 |\n| **触发类型** | `on_change`（值变化时触发） |\n| **绑定标签** | `PT101` |\n\n脚本体中预置了一个模板函数 `onChange(newValue, oldValue)`，当 P