nd_turn", "text": "目前项目中还没有配置任何数据点、趋势组或历史记录。要查看冷凝器出口的历史趋势并生成报表，需要先完成基础配置。\n\n需要你提供以下信息：\n\n**1. 关于冷凝器出口点位：**\n- 标签名（如 `COND_OUTLET_TEMP`）是什么？\n- 数据类型？（模拟量/数字量/字符串）\n- 工程单位？（如 °C、°F、kPa）\n- 量程范围？（如 0~100°C）\n\n**2. 关于历史趋势：**\n- 采样周期？（如每秒、每5秒）\n- 保留天数？（如 30天）\n\n**3. 关于报表：**\n- 报表类型？（班报/日报/自定义）\n- 需要统计哪些内容？（平均值、最大值、最小值等）\n- 输出格式？（PDF/Excel/CSV）\n\n如果你有现成的点位名称或具体参数，直接告诉我，我来帮你一步步配好。", "reasoning": "The project currently has no points, no trend groups, and no history configurations. I need to let the user know that the project is empty and ask them what they'd like to set up.\n\nSince the user is asking about \"冷凝器出口\" (condenser outlet), they likely want to:\n1. Create a point for the condenser outlet temperature or other measurement\n2. Enable history on that point\n3. Set up a trend to visualize it\n4. Maybe generate a report\n\nI should inform the user about the current empty state and ask for more details about what they want to configure."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53580, "output_tokens": 543, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14529.991199960932}, "judge": null}
