600002091, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部完成！✅ 以下是创建结果汇总：\n\n| Tag | 类型 | 单位 | 描述 | 历史记录 |\n|-----|------|------|------|---------|\n| **TI-201** | Analog | °C | Temperature Indicator 201 | ✅ 已开启 |\n| **PI-201** | Analog | bar | Pressure Indicator 201 | ✅ 已开启 |\n| **FI-201** | Analog | m³/h | Flow Indicator 201 | ✅ 已开启 |\n\n默认历史采样配置：周期采样，1秒间隔，保留30天。如需调整量程范围（min/max）、采样间隔或保留天数，请告诉我。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done! Both point creation and history enablement were successful."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 81210, "output_tokens": 696, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19705.6987999822}, "judge": null}
