t=10 for LL\n- priority: \"high\"\n\nSince these two alarm creations are independent of each other, I can call them in parallel.\n\nFor the HH alarm:\n- id: \"alarm_Ti201_HH\" \n- tag: \"TI-201\"\n- high_limit: 100\n- priority: \"high\"\n\nFor the LL alarm:\n- id: \"alarm_Ti201_LL\"\n- tag: \"TI-201\"\n\n\n- low_limit: 10\n- priority: \"high\"\n\nNow I'll execute both alarm creation calls simultaneously since they don't depend on each other."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27365, "output_tokens": 175, "latency_ms": 5425.030299986247, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警已成功创建！\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_TI201_HH` | TI-201 | HH（高高） | ≥ 100 | 🔴 high |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | TI-201 | LL（低低） | ≤ 10 | 🔴 high |\n\n当 TI-201 的温度值 **≥ 100** 或 **≤ 10** 时，将触发对应的高优先级报警。如需调整死区（deadband）或后续设置通知规则，请告知我。", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 54025, "output_tokens": 810, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18165.70509999292}, "judge": null}
