ate_widget with type \"button\"\n3. Bind the tank widget to TI-201\n4. Bind the button widget to CMD_START (for start functionality)\n\nLet me create both widgets first, then bind them. I can create both widgets in parallel since they don't depend on each other."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27375, "output_tokens": 187, "latency_ms": 3994.721799972467, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个组件已创建成功，接下来进行点位绑定：", "reasoning": "Both widgets created successfully. Now I need to bind them:\n1. Bind tank_201 to TI-201 (value property)\n2. Bind btn_start to CMD_START (value property, so pressing the button sets CMD_START to true)\n\nLet me do both bindings in parallel."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 80955, "output_tokens": 693, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20354.75040000165}, "judge": null}
