: "tool_use", "text": "我先确认一下点位 TI-201 是否存在，然后再创建报警。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create alarms for a tag called TI-201:\n1. A High-High (HH) alarm at 100 with high priority\n2. A Low-Low (LL) alarm at 10 with high priority\n\nI need to first check if the point TI-201 exists. Let me list the points to verify, or I can directly try to create the alarms.\n\nActually, let me first check if the point exists to make sure it's an analog point (since we need analog alarms with thresholds)."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26889, "output_tokens": 208, "latency_ms": 5868.967699992936, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 TI-201 存在且为模拟量点位。现在为您创建 HH 和 LL 两个报警：", "reasoning": "The point TI-201 exists and it's an analog type. Now I can create two alarms:\n1. HH alarm at 100, priority high\n2. LL alarm at 10, priority high\n\nI'll create two separate analog alarms with appropriate IDs."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53549, "output_tokens": 364, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 12805.0685999915}, "judge": null}
