{"id": "script_pi201_valve_protect", "name": "PI-201过高联锁保护", "trigger": "on_event", "body": "// PI-201过高联锁保护脚本\n// 触发条件：当PI-201压力值变化事件发生时执行\n\nfunction on_event(event_data) {\n    var pi201_value = read_tag(\"PI-201\");\n    var high_limit = 150.0;  // 高压阈值，请根据实际工艺调整\n\n    if (pi201_value > high_limit) {\n        log(\"WARNING: PI-201压力过高, 当前值=\" + pi201_value + \", 阈值=\" + high_limit);\n        write_tag(\"valve1\", true);  // 置位valve1，打开泄压阀\n        log(\"ACTION: valve1已置位(ON)\");\n    }\n}"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"script_id": "script_pi201_valve_protect"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"scripts.script_pi201_valve_protect": {"id": "script_pi201_valve_protect", "name": "PI-201过高联锁保护", "trigger": "on_event", "bound_tag": null, "period_s": null, "body": "// PI-201过高联锁保护脚本\n// 触发条件：当PI-201压力值变化事件发生时执行\n\nfunction on_event(event_data) {\n    var pi201_value = read_tag(\"PI-201\");\n    var high_limit = 150.0;  // 高压阈值，请根据实际工艺调整\n\n    if (pi201_value > high_limit) {\n        log(\"WARNING: PI-201压力过高, 当前值=\" + pi201_value + \", 阈值=\" + high_limit);\n        write_tag(\"valve1\", true);  // 置位valve1，打开泄压阀\n        log(\"ACTION: valve1已置位(ON)\");\n    }\n}", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.06910000229254365, "intended_entities": ["scripts.script_pi201_valve_protect"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": "sha256:880ca0ff66922dcfeb335aa3dee593a5f1b609bb814422d81c3ac84d421505bb", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26659, "output_tokens": 408, "latency_ms": 7989.036799990572, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为您创建一个 OnEvent 触发的全局脚本，实现 PI-201 过高时置位 valve1 的逻辑。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a new script with the following requirements:\n- Trigger type: on_event\n- Logic: If PI-201 is too high, then set valve1 (置位 means set to true/1)\n\nLet me create this script using the create_script function. I need to:\n1. Define an ID for the script\n2. Give it a name\n3. Set trigger to \"on_event\"\n4. Write the body with the logic\n\nThe body should check if PI-201 value exceeds a threshold (the user said \"过高\" which means \"too high\"), and if so, set valve1 to true/1.\n\nLet me create the script with appropriate logic."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27108, "output_tokens": 237, "latency_ms": 6105.5869000265375, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **全局脚本创建成功！**\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **脚本ID** | `script_pi201_valve_protect` |\n| **名称** | PI-201过高联锁保护 |\n| **触发类型** | `on_event` |\n\n**脚本逻辑说明：**\n\n```\n当事件触发时：\n  1. 读取 PI-201 压力值\n  2. 判断是否超过高压阈值 (默认150.0)\n  3. 如果过高 → 置位 valve1 = true\n```\n\n⚠️ **注意事项：**\n- 脚本中的 `high_limit = 150.0` 是示例值，请根据实际工艺要求调整\n- 确保 `PI-201` 和 `valve1` 这两个点位已在系统中定义\n- 如需修改阈值或逻辑，可以随时告诉我更新脚本\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The script was created successfully. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53767, "output_tokens": 645, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14238.484299974516}, "judge": null}
