ed)\n3. Then bind points to widgets (depends on widgets being created)\n\nI should also check if the points PumpA and PumpB exist. If they don't, I might need to create them first or ask the user.\n\nLet me start by creating the page and checking existing points in parallel."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27176, "output_tokens": 231, "latency_ms": 5146.908599999733, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面已创建，PumpA 和 PumpB 点位已存在。现在添加两个泵图元：", "reasoning": "The page has been created and the points PumpA and PumpB already exist. Now I need to:\n1. Create 2 pump widgets on the page\n2. Bind them to PumpA and PumpB\n\nI can create both widgets in parallel since they don't depend on each other."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27470, "output_tokens": 168, "latency_ms": 4570.592699979898, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵图元已创建。现在绑定点位：", "reasoning": "Both pump widgets have been created. Now I need to bind them to the PumpA and PumpB points. For a pump widget, I should bind the \"value\" property (which controls the on/off state) to the digital tags."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 81302, "output_tokens": 787, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22552.244000020437}, "judge": null}
