id": "main", "name": "主画面"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.027200032491236925, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7594b0d339dd171671a56b95048f5db7ed6f220f510a7a336df0828ff5aea13a", "final_hash": "sha256:7594b0d339dd171671a56b95048f5db7ed6f220f510a7a336df0828ff5aea13a", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26643, "output_tokens": 238, "latency_ms": 6696.989200019743, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查看一下现有的页面列表，找到\"主画面\"的信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to duplicate/copy an existing page called \"主画面\" (Main Screen) and rename it to \"备用画面\" (Backup Screen). \n\nLet me think about what tools I have available:\n- `list_pages` - to find the existing page\n- `create_page` - to create a new page (but this creates a blank page, not a copy)\n- `rename_page` - to rename a page\n- `delete_page` - to delete a page\n\nUnfortunately, I don't see a \"clone_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" tool in the available tools. The `create_page` tool only creates a new empty page with given resolution and background.\n\nLet me first check what pages exist using `list_pages`, and then explain to the user that I don't have a page duplication tool available. I can only create a new blank page with the same resolution/background, but it won't copy the widgets and other content from the original page.\n\nLet me first list the pages to see what's available."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26931, "output_tokens": 361, "latency_ms": 9648.737000010442, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了\"主画面\"（ID: `main`）。不过很抱歉，当前系统**不支持直接复制页面**功能。我可用的工具只能：\n\n- **创建新空白页面** — 但无法自动复制原页面上的控件、图形和数据绑定\n- **重命名现有页面** — 只能改名，不能复制\n\n**有两个替代方案供您选择：**\n\n1. **创建一个同规格的空白\"备用页面\"**  \n   我可以新建一个名为\"备用画面\"的空白页面（与主画面相同的分辨率和背景），之后您可以手动添加所需控件。\n\n2. **将\"主画面\"直接改名为\"备用画面\"**  \n   如果您只是想把当前主画面换个名字，我可以直接重命名。\n\n请问您希望采用哪种方案？或者如果您需要完整的页面克隆功能，可能需要联系系统管理员启用相关模块。", "reasoning": "Found the page \"主画面\" with id \"main\". Now, the user wants to duplicate/copy this page and rename it to \"备用画面\". \n\nHowever, looking at the available tools, I don't have a \"clone_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" function. The tools I have are:\n- `create_page` - Creates a new blank page (doesn't copy widgets)\n- `rename_page` - Renames an existing page\n- `delete_page` - Deletes a page\n\nI cannot truly \"copy\" a page with all its widgets and bindings. I should inform the user that the current toolset doesn't support page duplication. I can only create a new blank page with the same resolution and background color, but the widgets and bindings won't be copied over.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about this limitation."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53574, "output_tokens": 599, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16464.05589999631}, "judge": null}
