"points": [{"tag": "Temp_A", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "Temp_B", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.06700004450976849, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:fd3376207aa1c209411d06658236c2bed8c433d4f866aec47eed5e7b515f59d2", "final_hash": "sha256:fd3376207aa1c209411d06658236c2bed8c433d4f866aec47eed5e7b515f59d2", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 361, "latency_ms": 12336.720399965998, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你处理这个需求。首先，我需要查看现有的点位，找出所有带\"Temp\"的温度点。", "reasoning": "The user wants to raise the alarm priority to \"high\" for all temperature points that have \"Temp\" in their name. \n\nFirst, I need to understand what's available. I should:\n1. List all points to find the ones with \"Temp\" in their tag names\n2. Then I need to find existing alarms on those points\n3. But wait - I don't see a \"list_alarms\" tool in my available tools\n\nLet me check my available tools again:\n- create_analog_alarm\n- create_digital_alarm\n- set_threshold\n- enable_alarm\n- disable_alarm\n- delete_alarm\n\nI don't have a way to list existing alarms or update alarm priority directly. The tools I have are:\n- create_analog_alarm - creates a new alarm with a priority\n- set_threshold - only updates threshold/deadband, not priority\n\nSo I have a problem here. I cannot:\n1. List existing alarms to see which ones are on \"Temp\" points\n2. Update the priority of existing alarms (no such tool exists)\n\nI should first list points to find the temperature points, but then I need to figure out how to handle the alarm priority change. Since I don't have tools to list alarms or update alarm priority, I should:\n\n1. First call list_points to see what points exist with \"Temp\" in them\n2. Then explain to the user the limitation - I cannot change priority on existing alarms, I would need to delete and recreate them\n\nLet me start by listing the points to understand what we're working with."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27113, "output_tokens": 425, "latency_ms": 11892.406500002835, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了2个温度点：**Temp_A** 和 **Temp_B**，都是模拟量类型。\n\n不过我需要向您说明一个限制：**目前我没有直接修改现有报警优先级的工具**。系统中只有以下报警相关操作：\n- 创建新报警（可指定优先级）\n- 修改报警阈值/死区\n- 启用/禁用/删除报警\n\n要实现您的需求，有两种方案：\n\n**方案一**：如果这些点已有报警 → 需要先删除旧报警，再用 `high` 优先级重新创建\n\n**方案二**：如果这些点还没有报警 → 可以直接创建高优先级的报警\n\n请告诉我：\n1. 这些温度点是否已经配置了报警？\n2. 如果已有报警，它们的高限/低限值分别是多少？（我会用相同的限值重新创建，但优先级设为 high）\n3. 如果还没有报警，您希望设置什么高限和低限？", "reasoning": "I found two temperature points: Temp_A and Temp_B, both are analog type. \n\nNow I need to raise their alarm priority to \"high\". But I have a problem - I don't have tools to:\n1. List existing alarms on these points\n2. Update alarm priority directly\n\nThe set_threshold tool only updates threshold/deadband, not priority. The only way to set priority is when creating a new alarm with create_analog_alarm.\n\nI don't know if these points have existing alarms. I should explain this situation to the user. I could:\n1. Ask the user if these points already have alarms that need priority changed, or\n2. If they need new alarms created with high priority\n\nActually, looking at the behavior guidelines, I should inform the user about this limitation. I cannot change the priority of existing alarms - there's no tool for that. I would need to delete existing alarms and recreate them with high priority, or if there are no alarms, create new ones.\n\nLet me inform the user of this limitation and ask for clarification."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53761, "output_tokens": 786, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24338.370999961626}, "judge": null}
