e a trend page with a trend chart bound to historical data. Let me break this down:\n\n1. First, I need to create an HMI page for trends\n2. Then create a trend group on that page\n3. The user wants to bind it to historical data, so I'll need to know which tags to plot\n\nBut I should first check what points/tags exist in the project, and what pages already exist. Let me ask the user for more details or check the current state.\n\nActually, let me first check what points exist in the project so I can suggest tags for the trend, and also check existing pages."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26896, "output_tokens": 229, "latency_ms": 7950.112099992111, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中还没有定义任何点位（tags）和页面。趋势图表需要绑定至少一个 SCADA 点位才能显示数据。\n\n在继续之前，我需要确认一下：\n\n1. **你想绑定哪些点位到趋势图？** 例如温度、压力、流量等标签名。\n2. 如果还没有点位，我可以先帮你创建几个示例点位（比如 `TEMP_101`、`PRESS_101`、`FLOW_101`），然后再绑定到趋势图上。\n\n请告诉我你的需求，或者我可以直接创建一组常见的模拟点位供演示使用？", "reasoning": "The project has no points and no pages yet. I need to ask the user what tags they want to monitor in the trend chart. Without any points, there's nothing to bind to.\n\nLet me ask the user:\n1. What SCADA points/tags they want to trend (or should I create some example points?)\n2. Or should I create example points first?\n\nI should inform the user that there are currently no points defined, and ask them what they'd like to do."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53543, "output_tokens": 411, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14039.931999985129}, "judge": null}
