显示（使用 tank 控件）\n7. 文本标签"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 28603, "output_tokens": 797, "latency_ms": 13669.061499997042, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "继续添加仪表显示组件：", "reasoning": "好的，继续添加仪表控件来显示模拟量数据。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 29692, "output_tokens": 432, "latency_ms": 9736.518700025044, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "现在绑定点位到各个控件：", "reasoning": "现在需要绑定点位到控件，然后添加故障报警显示区域，最后配置报警。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 30365, "output_tokens": 494, "latency_ms": 10488.175700011197, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位绑定完成！添加故障报警显示和页面标题：", "reasoning": "好的，现在添加故障报警显示区域和标题，然后配置报警。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 31087, "output_tokens": 78, "latency_ms": 6152.373199991416, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "绑定故障指示灯：", "reasoning": "现在绑定故障信号到故障指示灯，然后配置报警。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 201608, "output_tokens": 3229, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 76589.02650000528}, "judge": null}
