ld_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26652, "output_tokens": 522, "latency_ms": 14390.905799984466, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来帮你搞一个\"演示用假点位\"配置流程——创建模拟点、配高低报警、开趋势图。\n\n先让我看看项目里现在有哪些页面可以放趋势图：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Create fake/non-existent points\n2. Create a bunch of high/low alarms on them\n3. Create a trend graph to view them\n\nLet me think about this carefully. The user is essentially asking me to create SCADA points that don't correspond to real physical devices (\"假点位\" = fake points), configure alarms on them, and set up trend displays.\n\nThis is actually a reasonable request in many SCADA contexts:\n- Testing/development environments\n- Training systems\n- Proof of concept demonstrations\n- Simulating a system before real hardware is connected\n\nThere's no safety concern here - creating points with alarms and trends is a standard SCADA configuration task. The \"fake\" nature just means these are simulation/test points, which is completely normal in SCADA project development.\n\nHowever, the user hasn't specified:\n- What tags to create\n- What types (analog/digital)\n- What alarm limits\n- What page to put the trend on\n\nI should ask the user for these specifics, or I could propose a reasonable demo setup. Given the casual/playful tone of the request (\"假点位\", \"一大堆\"), they seem to want me to just demonstrate the workflow with some example data.\n\nLet me create a reasonable demo setup:\n- A few analog points (e.g., temperature, pressure, level)\n- High/low alarms on them\n- A trend group to display them\n\nBut I should ask for specifics since I don't know:\n- Tag names\n- Alarm limits\n- Page ID for the trend\n\nActually, given the casual tone, I think the user wants me to just do it with reasonable defaults. Let me propose a setup and execute it.\n\nWait, I need to know if there's an existing page for the trend. Let me first check for existing pages, and also I should propose reasonable defaults.\n\nLet me just ask the user for the minimal info I need - what they want to call the points and what alarm limits, or if they want me to make it all up with reasonable defaults.\n\n\nThe user clearly wants me to proceed with a full demonstration using sensible defaults. I'll start by checking what pages already exist in the system, then create several analog points with appropriate alarm configurations and set up trend displays for them."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27211, "output_tokens": 497, "latency_ms": 10865.532500029076, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "没页面，我先创建一个，然后批量搞假点位：", "reasoning": "No pages exist yet. I need to create a page first, then create the points, alarms, and trend group. Let me do this step by step.\n\nI'll create:\n1. A page for the trend display\n2. Several \"fake\" analog points (temperature, pressure, flow, level)\n3. High/low alarms on each\n4. A trend group with pens for each point\n\nLet me start by creating the page and all the points at once."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27867, "output_tokens": 768, "latency_ms": 13476.76320001483, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好，页面和四个假点位就位。现在给它们绑上**一大堆高低报**：", "reasoning": "Good, page and points created. Now let me create alarms on all four points. I'll make them with reasonable limits:\n\n- TEMP: high 150°C, low 10°C\n- PRESS: high 8 MPa, low 0.5 MPa\n- FLOW: high 400 m³/h, low 20 m³/h\n- LEVEL: high 90%, low 10%\n\nAnd then create a trend group with pens for all four points."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 28970, "output_tokens": 609, "latency_ms": 13106.94179998245, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "哎呀，null 不能传字符串，让我修正一下，只传需要的限值：", "reasoning": "I see - I need to omit the parameters I don't want to set rather than passing null. Let me retry without the None parameters."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 29914, "output_tokens": 121, "latency_ms": 5046.181399957277, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我单个试试看问题在哪：", "reasoning": "Hmm, still getting schema errors. The issue might be with how I'm passing the parameters. Let me try one at a time to debug. Maybe there's something wrong with the JSON structure. Let me try a simple one first."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 140614, "output_tokens": 2517, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 59009.3377000303}, "judge": null}
