ties": ["pages.sewage_pump_overview.widgets.pump_02"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.sewage_pump_overview"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:27e1ce79f4519a7c9beff5aab6a6247a490b80acc564f794ee230ab45b6f2664", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26662, "output_tokens": 251, "latency_ms": 8307.740999967791, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为您创建污水泵站总览画面。首先创建页面，然后添加标题和两台泵的占位。\n\n**第一步：创建页面**", "reasoning": "The user wants to create an HMI page for a sewage pump station overview. Let me break down the requirements:\n\n1. Create a page: sewage pump station overview, black background, 1920x1080 resolution\n2. Add a title text\n3. Add two pump widgets as placeholders\n\nI can do this with the available tools. Let me:\n1. First create the page with black background and 1920x1080 resolution\n2. Then create the title text and two pump widgets\n\nSince creating the page must happen first (the widgets need a page_id), I'll create the page first, then add the text and pumps.\n\nLet me create the page first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26952, "output_tokens": 357, "latency_ms": 10879.320900014136, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面创建成功！接下来添加标题和两台泵的占位：", "reasoning": "Good, the page is created. Now I'll add the title and two pump widgets. These can all be done in parallel since they don't depend on each other."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27422, "output_tokens": 297, "latency_ms": 8677.152200019918, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **污水泵站总览画面创建完成！** 布局如下：\n\n| 组件 | Widget ID | 位置 | 说明 |\n|------|-----------|------|------|\n| 📄 页面 | `sewage_pump_overview` | — | 黑底 1920×1080 |\n| 🏷️ 标题 | `title_label` | (660, 40) | \"污水泵站总览\"，白色36号加粗字 |\n| 🔄 1#泵 | `pump_01` | (400, 350) | 300×300 蓝色泵图标 |\n| 🔄 2#泵 | `pump_02` | (1100, 350) | 300×300 蓝色泵图标 |\n\n---\n\n**后续可做：**\n- 绑定点位：用 `bind_point` 将泵的运行状态/故障等 tag 绑定到泵控件\n- 添加更多组件：如水位计（thermometer/tank）、管道（line）、阀门（valve）等\n- 创建对应的 SCADA 点位和报警\n\n需要继续完善这个画面吗？", "reasoning": "All widgets have been created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 81036, "output_tokens": 905, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 28008.136199961882}, "judge": null}
