"world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.02300000051036477, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26642, "output_tokens": 187, "latency_ms": 7156.777099997271, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想修改某个画面的颜色，使其更好看。但信息不足——我需要知道具体是哪个页面，以及想修改哪些元素的颜色。当前处于 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，需要先收集更多信息。\n\n我需要先了解当前有哪些页面，然后才能确定要修改哪个页面。可以调用 list_pages 来查看现有页面。同时，我也需要知道用户想修改哪些元素的颜色——是背景色、某个特定小部件的颜色，还是整个页面的配色方案？\n\n所以，先调用 list_pages 获取页面列表，然后根据用户的具体需求，再询问要修改哪个页面以及哪些元素的颜色。也许还需要调用 list_points 来了解有哪些点位，以便更好地配色？但颜色修改主要是 HMI 页面的视觉方面，所以 list_pages 应该足够了。\n\n开始行动。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26866, "output_tokens": 320, "latency_ms": 11285.772900038864, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中还没有任何画面（页面）。您是想创建一个新页面并设置好看的颜色，还是指其他内容？请告诉我：\n\n1. **画面名称**：您希望创建的新页面叫什么名字？\n2. **分辨率**：默认是 1920×1080，您有特殊要求吗？\n3. **背景色**：想要什么颜色的背景？（例如 #2C3E50 深蓝灰、#ECF0F1 浅灰、#1ABC9C 青绿色等）\n4. **主要元素**：页面上需要放置哪些设备或控件（比如温度计、泵、储罐等）？\n\n有了这些信息，我就可以帮您设计一个美观的配色方案并创建页面。", "reasoning": "当前没有页面。所以用户可能是想创建一个新页面，并设置好看的颜色。或者，他们可能指的是现有页面，但列表为空。可能他们想修改的是某个其他项目的页面？但当前项目是空的。\n\n因此，我需要向用户澄清：当前没有页面。是需要创建一个新页面并设置好看的颜色吗？还是想修改其他内容？\n\n接下来，询问用户具体需求。回复应该用中文，因为用户使用的是中文。同时，考虑到当前处于 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，我需要获取更多信息。我会问：目前没有发现现有的画面（页面）。您是想创建一个新页面并设置好看的颜色，还是指其他内容？请提供更多信息。\n\n现在，生成回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53508, "output_tokens": 507, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18560.348899976816}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "647b053a-087f-4758-8ca0-520e5998d4bc", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:e8b4dbe1adf3ba3946f56d539dd39a0d38160a460ad5d7e39ec33aae56470c3f", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-033", "text": "复制反应釜模板画面为reactor_12，标题改成12号反应釜并保留罐体绑定", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T05:32:53.358Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T05:33:19.113Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T05:32:53.358Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T05:33:19.113Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}, {"name": "create_device"}, {"name": "update_device"}, {"name": "delete_device"}, {"name": "configure_device_params"}, {"name": "get_device_status"}, {"name": "list_devices"}, {"name": "create_trend_group"}, {"name": "add_trend_pen"}, {"name": "configure_trend_axis"}, {"name": "set_trend_sampling"}, {"name": "enable_trend_scroll"}, {"name": "delete_trend_group"}, {"name": "list_trend_groups"}, {"name": "create_recipe"}, {"name": "add_recipe_step"}, {"name": "set_recipe_parameter"}, {"name": "validate_recipe"}, {"name": "activate_recipe"}, {"name": "clone_recipe"}, {"name": "list_recipes"}, {"name": "create_user"}, {"name": "assign_user_role"}, {"name": "set_user_permissions"}, {"name": "lock_user"}, {"name": "reset_user_password"}, {"name": "configure_session"}, {"name": "list_users"}, {"name": "configure_driver"}, {"name": "start_polling"}, {"name": "stop_polling"}, {"name": "test_connection"}, {"name": "get_comm_stats"}, {"name": "reset_driver"}, {"name": "list_drivers"}, {"name": "create_report_template"}, {"name": "add_report_section"}, {"name": "configure_report_schedule"}, {"name": "generate_report"}, {"name": "set_report_format"}, {"name": "export_report"}, {"name": "list_report_templates"}, {"name": "create_schedule"}, {"name": "set_schedule_trigger"}, {"name": "add_schedule_action"}, {"name": "enable_schedule"}, {"name": "get_schedule_status"}, {"name": "list_schedules"}, {"name": "configure_audit_log"}, {"name": "export_audit_trail"}, {"name": "set_password_policy"}, {"name": "check_compliance"}, {"name": "backup_project"}, {"name": "restore_project"}, {"name": "create_database_table"}, {"name": "configure_database_connection"}, {"name": "execute_sql_query"}, {"name": "set_retention_policy"}, {"name": "list_databases"}, {"name": "create_notification_rule"}, {"name": "configure_notification_channel"}, {"name": "add_escalation_level"}], "visible_count": 100, "selected": "list_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "reactor_template", "name": "反应釜模板"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.02239999594166875, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:c2a4397e34f829d22244f534ffd63ae13200839d3dc0aebeae2f0c044d04af5b", "final_hash": "sha256:c2a4397e34f829d22244f534ffd63ae13200839d3dc0aebeae2f0c044d04af5b", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26657, "output_tokens": 377, "latency_ms": 11583.395000023302, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查看现有的页面列表，找到反应釜模板画面。", "reasoning": "The user wants to copy/clone a reactor template page to create a new page called \"reactor_12\", with the title changed to \"12号反应釜\" (Reactor #12), while preserving the tank bindings.\n\nLet me analyze the available tools:\n1. `list_pages` - to see existing pages and find the reactor template\n2. `create_page` - to create a new page\n3. `rename_page` - to change the display name\n4. `clone_recipe` - this is for recipes, not pages\n\nUnfortunately, I don't see a \"clone_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" function in my available tools. Let me check the tools again:\n\n- create_page: Create a new HMI page\n- rename_page: Change the display name of an existing page\n- delete_page: Delete a page and all its widgets\n- create_widget: Place a widget on a page\n- bind_point: Bind a SCADA point tag to a widget property\n- list_pages: Return the list of pages\n\nThere's no clone/duplicate page function. The user wants to:\n1. Find a reactor template page\n2. Clone it to create \"reactor_12\"\n3. Change the title to \"12号反应釜\"\n4. Preserve tank bindings\n\nSince there's no clone page function, I should first list the pages to see what exists, and then explain to the user that there's no direct clone function. However, I could potentially:\n1. List pages to find the template\n2. Create a new page\n3. Manually recreate widgets and bindings\n\nLet me first list the pages to see what's available, then explain the situation."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27087, "output_tokens": 607, "latency_ms": 14066.592600021977, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了反应釜模板页面（ID: `reactor_template`，名称：反应釜模板）。\n\n**很抱歉，当前工具集不支持页面克隆/复制功能。**\n\n具体来说，系统存在以下限制：\n1. **没有 `clone_page` 或 `duplicate_page` 工具** — 无法直接复制一个页面及其所有控件和绑定\n2. **没有 `list_widgets` 工具** — 无法查看模板页面上有哪些控件来手动重建\n\n---\n\n### 可行的替代方案：\n\n**方案 A：通过 SCADA 工程软件操作**\n在 HMI 编辑器中直接右键复制\"反应釜模板\"页面，粘贴后修改标题即可，所有控件和绑定会自动保留。\n\n**方案 B：我帮你从零创建新页面**\n如果你告诉我模板页面上需要哪些控件（例如：罐体、温度计、泵、阀门等）以及它们绑定的点位标签，我可以：\n1. 创建新页面 `reactor_12`，标题为\"12号反应釜\"\n2. 逐一创建控件并绑定对应的 SCADA 点位\n\n---\n\n请问你希望采用哪种方案？如果选方案 B，请提供模板页面上的控件清单和绑定信息。", "reasoning": "I found the reactor template page with id \"reactor_template\" and name \"反应釜模板\". \n\nNow the problem is that I don't have a \"clone_page\" function available. Let me think about what I can do:\n\n1. I can create a new page for \"reactor_12\"\n2. But I cannot automatically copy all widgets and bindings from the template\n\nI should inform the user that there's no clone/duplicate page function available in the current toolset. The available tools for pages are:\n- create_page\n- rename_page\n- delete_page\n- create_widget\n- bind_point\n- list_pages\n- create_rect, create_circle, create_line, create_text\n- apply_flow_layout, group_widgets, set_widget_style, delete_widget\n\nSince there's no way to programmatically clone a page with all its widgets and bindings, I need to explain this limitation to the user and suggest an alternative approach - I would need to manually recreate each widget and binding, but I don't have a way to inspect what widgets exist on the template page to know what to recreate.\n\nActually, wait - there's no \"list_widgets\" or \"get_page_details\" function either. So I can't even see what widgets are on the template page to manually recreate them.\n\nI should be honest with the user that:\n1. The current toolset doesn't include a page cloning function\n2. There's no way to inspect the template page's widgets to manually copy them\n3. This would need to be done through the SCADA system's UI directly, or additional tools would need to be provided\n\nLet me explain this to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53744, "output_tokens": 984, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25754.830399993807}, "judge": null}
