sensor (analog)\n3. A level sensor (analog)\n4. A flow sensor (analog)\n\nThese are common industrial sensors. Let me create them all at once since they're independent operations."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27197, "output_tokens": 255, "latency_ms": 9064.154300023802, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已成功创建 **4 个传感器点位**，详细信息如下：\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 单位 | 量程 | 说明 |\n|---------|------|------|------|------|\n| `TEMP_101` | 模拟量 | °C | -40 ~ 200 | 反应釜温度传感器 |\n| `PRES_101` | 模拟量 | kPa | 0 ~ 1600 | 管道压力传感器 |\n| `LEVEL_101` | 模拟量 | % | 0 ~ 100 | 储罐液位传感器 |\n| `FLOW_101` | 模拟量 | m³/h | 0 ~ 500 | 管道流量传感器 |\n\n这些都是工业现场最常见的传感器类型。如果你需要：\n- 📊 **配置报警**（如温度高报警、液位低报警）\n- 📈 **开启历史记录**（数据存储到历史库）\n- 🔗 **绑定到 HMI 画面**\n\n随时告诉我！", "reasoning": "All four sensor points were created successfully. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53840, "output_tokens": 685, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19230.853500019293}, "judge": null}
