{"trace_id": "b59ce78a-89a9-40e5-a148-f325d2131297", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:e8b4dbe1adf3ba3946f56d539dd39a0d38160a460ad5d7e39ec33aae56470c3f", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-043", "text": "把TEMP_ZONE_1现有高温报警优先级从medium提升到high", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:24.422Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:47.974Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:24.422Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:47.974Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 784, "latency_ms": 23471.613300032914, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前没有直接修改报警优先级的工具。不过，我可以帮您删除现有报警，然后重新创建一个具有相同配置但优先级设为 `high` 的新报警。\n\n要完成这个操作，我需要知道：\n1. 现有报警的 ID（例如 `alarm_temp_high_101`）\n2. 您希望新报警使用什么 ID？\n\n或者，如果您不介意删除现有报警，我可以：\n1. 删除现有报警\n2. 创建新报警，标签为 `TEMP_ZONE_1`，优先级设为 `high`\n\n请告诉我您希望如何进行。", "reasoning": "用户想要提升现有温度报警的优先级。这看起来是修改现有报警配置的操作。我需要检查是否有工具可以修改报警优先级。目前可用的报警相关工具有：创建模拟量报警、创建数字量报警、设置阈值、启用报警、禁用报警、删除报警。似乎没有直接修改报警优先级的工具。\n\n我需要先查看现有的报警配置。也许可以通过某种方式间接实现，比如删除后重新创建，但用户明确要求提升优先级。不过，我可以先询问用户是否接受删除并重新创建的方式，或者建议使用其他方法。\n\n但首先，我需要了解当前有哪些报警配置。也许我可以使用某种查询工具，但当前可用工具中没有列出报警的工具。可能需要向用户询问更多信息，或者尝试其他方法。\n\n让我看看是否有其他相关工具。也许我可以切换到另一个阶段，比如ASK_USER阶段来询问更多细节。但根据当前阶段ANALYZE_INTENT，我可能需要先分析意图，然后决定下一步。\n\n实际上，用户的需求是明确的：提升现有报警优先级。这可能无法直接实现，但可以通过删除并重新创建来实现。我需要告知用户这一限制，并询问是否继续。\n\n那么，我应该先尝试查找与TEMP_ZONE_1相关的现有报警。也许可以使用一些查询工具，但当前没有列出报警的工具。我可以尝试使用create_analog_alarm工具，但它是用于创建新报警的，而不是修改。\n\n让我重新审视一下可用工具。确实，没有直接修改报警优先级的工具。也许用户需要删除现有报警并重新创建，但这样可能会丢失其他配置。\n\n我应该向用户说明这个限制，并询问是否接受删除并重新创建的方式。或者，我可以建议使用其他方法，比如创建一个新报警并禁用旧报警，但这样可能会造成混乱。\n\n考虑到这些，我应该先询问用户TEMP_ZONE_1是否已经有一个报警。也许我可以假设它已经存在，但最好还是确认一下。\n\n那么，我的回复可以这样：先说明没有直接修改优先级的工具，但可以删除并重新创建。询问用户是否希望这样做。同时，我需要提供具体的步骤。\n\n不过，也许还有其他方法。我可以尝试使用set_threshold工具，但它只用于修改阈值和死区，而不是优先级。确实没有修改优先级的工具。\n\n因此，我需要向用户说明情况，并询问是否继续删除并重新创建。我还需要获取报警ID。也许用户知道报警ID，或者我可以询问。\n\n让我这样回复：解释限制，询问报警ID，然后提供删除和重新创建的步骤。\n\n但首先，我需要确认用户是否希望这样做。那么，我将询问用户是否接受删除并重新创建的方式。\n\n我将这样回复：\n\n\"目前没有直接修改报警优先级的工具。我可以帮您删除现有报警并重新创建一个相同但优先级为high的报警。请问您能提供现有报警的ID吗？或者您希望我为您创建一个新报警，优先级设为high？\"\n\n这看起来是一个合理的回复。不过，也许还有其他方法。也许我可以尝试使用enable_alarm或disable_alarm，但它们无法修改优先级。\n\n那么，我就这样回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 784, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23552.363599999808}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "f0f75481-b801-4a03-b693-81bc5a1839c5", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:e8b4dbe1adf3ba3946f56d539dd39a0d38160a460ad5d7e39ec33aae56470c3f", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-043", "text": "把TEMP_ZONE_1现有高温报警优先级从medium提升到high", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:36.681Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:53.484Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:36.682Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:53.484Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 587, "latency_ms": 16731.42279998865, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "很抱歉，当前可用的工具中**没有直接修改报警优先级**的功能。\n\n`set_threshold` 工具只能更新模拟报警的阈值（high_limit、low_limit、deadband），无法修改优先级字段。\n\n**可行的替代方案：**\n\n1. **删除并重新创建报警** — 先用 `delete_alarm` 删除现有报警，再用 `create_analog_alarm` 重新创建一个优先级为 `high` 的报警。但这需要知道该报警的完整参数（报警ID、阈值限值等）。\n\n2. **建议产品功能改进** — 如果这是一次性操作，可能需要在后台直接修改配置。\n\n请问您是否希望采用方案1（删除并重建）？如果是，我需要先了解以下信息：\n\n- 该高温报警的 **报警ID** 是什么？\n- 当前设置的 **高温限值（high_limit）** 是多少？\n- 是否有 **低温限值（low_limit）** 和 **死区（deadband）**？\n\n或者，我可以先帮您查看项目中现有的点位和报警配置，以获取这些信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to change the priority of an existing alarm for TEMP_ZONE_1 from medium to high. Let me think about what tools are available for this.\n\nLooking at the available alarm-related tools:\n- create_analog_alarm: Creates a new alarm\n- create_digital_alarm: Creates a new digital alarm\n- set_threshold: Update threshold/deadband on an existing analog alarm\n- enable_alarm: Enable a previously disabled alarm\n- disable_alarm: Temporarily disable an alarm\n- delete_alarm: Remove an alarm definition entirely\n\nUnfortunately, none of these tools directly support changing the priority of an existing alarm. The `set_threshold` tool only updates threshold/deadband, not priority.\n\nLet me check if there's any other tool that could help... No, there isn't a tool specifically for updating alarm priority.\n\nThe current phase is ANALYZE_INTENT. The available tools don't include a direct way to update alarm priority. I should inform the user that the current toolset doesn't support directly modifying an alarm's priority setting.\n\nI could suggest a workaround: delete the existing alarm and recreate it with the high priority. But I need to know the alarm ID first. Let me think about what to do.\n\nActually, I should be honest with the user that the available tools don't include a way to update alarm priority directly. The set_threshold tool only handles threshold and deadband, not priority.\n\nI should inform the user of this limitation and ask if they want me to:\n1. Delete the existing alarm and recreate it with high priority (but I'd need to know the alarm ID and the limits)\n2. Or if there's another approach they'd prefer\n\nLet me respond to the user explaining the situation."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 587, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16802.440500003286}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "2716d930-3c72-42e4-9cfc-1fca8d260f11", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:e8b4dbe1adf3ba3946f56d539dd39a0d38160a460ad5d7e39ec33aae56470c3f", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-043", "text": "把TEMP_ZONE_1现有高温报警优先级从medium提升到high", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:49.591Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T05:37:09.156Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T05:36:49.591Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T05:37:09.156Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 645, "latency_ms": 19514.511700021103, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前可用的工具中没有直接修改现有报警优先级的功能。不过可以通过**先删除旧报警，再用相同配置（但优先级为 high）重新创建**来实现。\n\n在操作前，我需要确认以下信息：\n\n1. **报警 ID**：TEMP_ZONE_1 的高温报警 ID 是什么？（例如 `alarm_temp_zone1_high`）\n2. **高温限值（high_limit）**：高温报警的触发阈值是多少？\n3. **是否有低温限值（low_limit）** 和 **死区（deadband）** 需要保留？\n\n请提供这些信息，我就可以帮您完成优先级提升。", "reasoning": "The user wants to change the priority of an existing high temperature alarm for TEMP_ZONE_1 from medium to high.\n\nLet me analyze the request:\n- They want to modify an existing alarm on tag TEMP_ZONE_1\n- Change priority from medium to high\n\nLooking at the available tools, I don't see a direct \"update alarm priority\" tool. Let me check what's available:\n- create_analog_alarm - creates new alarms\n- set_threshold - updates threshold/deadband\n- enable_alarm / disable_alarm - enable/disable\n- delete_alarm - remove alarm\n\nNone of these tools directly update the priority of an existing alarm. The set_threshold tool only allows updating high_limit, low_limit, and deadband - not priority.\n\nHowever, I should check if there's a workaround or if I need to inform the user. The tools available don't include a direct \"update alarm priority\" function.\n\nWait, let me re-read the tools more carefully. The create_analog_alarm has a priority field, but that's for creating new alarms. set_threshold doesn't have a priority parameter.\n\nI have a few options:\n1. Inform the user that there's no direct tool to update alarm priority\n2. Suggest a workaround: delete the old alarm and create a new one with high priority\n\nBut option 2 would be a destructive operation (deleting and recreating), which could cause issues if other things reference that alarm ID.\n\nActually, looking at the high-risk operation guidelines, I should be careful. But this is just changing priority, which is a common configuration change.\n\nSince I don't have a direct tool to update alarm priority, I should inform the user about this limitation and suggest the workaround (delete + recreate) while asking for confirmation since it's a destructive operation.\n\nBut wait - let me reconsider. The user's request is straightforward. I should first check if there's an existing alarm. Let me think about what tools can help me understand the current state...\n\n\nI can't list alarms directly, and there's no tool to query existing alarm configurations either. Given these constraints, I should be transparent with the user that the available toolset doesn't support modifying alarm priority directly. I'll explain that the current tools allow creating, deleting, enabling/disabling alarms, and adjusting thresholds, but not changing priority on existing alarms. The workaround would require deleting the current alarm and creating a replacement with the desired high priority setting. I need to confirm the alarm ID and high limit values before proceeding."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26648, "output_tokens": 645, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19564.76420001127}, "judge": null}
