l), `PUMP_A_HZ` (analog, Hz)\n\n现在我来创建泵A图元，并绑定两个点位。", "reasoning": "Both the page and points exist. Now I can:\n1. Create a pump widget on the \"pump_panel\" page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the pump's status (likely a \"status\" or \"value\" property)\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the pump's frequency (likely \"frequency\" property)\n\nLet me create the pump widget first. I'll place it at a reasonable position. The widget_id could be \"pump_a\"."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27259, "output_tokens": 184, "latency_ms": 6489.700200036168, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元已创建，接下来绑定运行状态和频率。", "reasoning": "The pump widget was created successfully. Now I need to bind the two points:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN → pump_a.status (or similar property for running status)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ → pump_a.frequency (or similar property for frequency)\n\nLet me make both bindings."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27515, "output_tokens": 170, "latency_ms": 4941.667900013272, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已完成所有配置，汇总如下：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `pump_panel`（泵面板） |\n| **图元** | `pump_a`（泵A），类型 `pump`，位置 (200, 200)，尺寸 120×120 |\n| **绑定1** | 运行状态 ← `PUMP_A_RUN`（数字量） |\n| **绑定2** | 频率 ← `PUMP_A_HZ`（模拟量，Hz） |\n\n泵A图元已成功添加到 pump_panel 画面，运行状态和频率均已绑定到对应点位。next_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All tasks completed successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 108422, "output_tokens": 765, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25349.48070003884}, "judge": null}
