Let me first check if the page \"pump_panel\" exists by listing pages."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26824, "output_tokens": 159, "latency_ms": 4339.587600028608, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "画面 `pump_panel`（泵面板）已存在。接下来创建泵A图元并绑定两个点位。", "reasoning": "The page \"pump_panel\" exists with name \"泵面板\". Now I'll create a pump widget on this page. I'll place it at a reasonable position and size."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27018, "output_tokens": 181, "latency_ms": 4903.144900046755, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元已创建成功，现在绑定两个点位：", "reasoning": "The pump widget has been created. Now I need to bind:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN to the run property (running status)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ to the frequency property\n\nI can make both bind_point calls at the same time since they're independent."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27271, "output_tokens": 190, "latency_ms": 4887.088300019968, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部配置完成！以下是操作摘要：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **画面** | `pump_panel`（泵面板） |\n| **图元** | `pump_a`（泵类型，150×150，位置 200,200） |\n| **运行状态绑定** | `pump_a.run` ← `PUMP_A_RUN` ✅ |\n| **频率绑定** | `pump_a.frequency` ← `PUMP_A_HZ` ✅ |\n\n现在泵A图元已放置在画面上，运行时将根据 `PUMP_A_RUN` 的开关状态显示启停，并实时显示 `PUMP_A_HZ` 的频率值。\n\n> 💡 如需调整图元位置、大小或样式，可以随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "All done successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 107772, "output_tokens": 643, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21212.027799978387}, "judge": null}
