et me create the tank widget first, then bind the points to it."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27302, "output_tokens": 222, "latency_ms": 8185.739499982446, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体控件创建成功，现在绑定三个点位：", "reasoning": "Tank widget created successfully. Now I need to bind the three points to it. The three bindings are independent of each other, so I can make them all in one block."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 80995, "output_tokens": 632, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25707.85219996469}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "0d0acd68-8c71-4e58-a9ae-3b98fa0c0d7c", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:e8b4dbe1adf3ba3946f56d539dd39a0d38160a460ad5d7e39ec33aae56470c3f", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-048", "text": "把source_page上的valve1复制到target_page，位置改到[300,120]，绑定保持VALVE_1_OPEN", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:04.461Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:18.748Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:04.462Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:18.748Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26665, "output_tokens": 477, "latency_ms": 14236.120200017467, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我来帮您完成这个操作。由于系统没有直接的\"复制小部件\"功能，我需要先创建一个新的阀门部件再绑定数据点。不过我需要先确认一下源页面上 valve1 的详细信息。\n\n目前我无法直接查询某个小部件的属性（类型、尺寸、样式），所以需要您提供以下信息：\n\n1. **部件类型** - valve1 的类型是什么？（例如 `valve`、`rect`、或其他自定义类型）\n2. **尺寸 (size)** - valve1 的宽和高是多少？（例如 `[60, 40]`）\n3. **绑定属性** - 原来绑定 `VALVE_1_OPEN` 的属性名是什么？（例如 `value`、`state`、`status`）\n4. **样式 (style)** - 如果有特殊样式（颜色、线宽等），请一并告知\n\n请提供这些信息后，我会在 `target_page` 上创建一个相同配置的阀门部件，位置设为 `[300, 120]`，并绑定到 `VALVE_1_OPEN`。", "reasoning": "The user wants to copy a widget called \"valve1\" from \"source_page\" to \"target_page\", change its position to [300, 120], and keep the binding to \"VALVE_1_OPEN\".\n\nLet me think about this. The available tools don't have a direct \"copy_widget\" function. However, I can accomplish this by:\n\n1. First, I need to know what the original widget looks like - but I don't have a \"get_widget\" or \"list_widgets\" tool to see the details of valve1 on source_page.\n\nActually, looking at the available tools, I don't have a way to query the details of an existing widget. I have `list_pages` but no `list_widgets` for a page.\n\n\nI'm running into a fundamental limitation here - without a tool to retrieve the source widget's properties like its type, size, and style, I can't accurately replicate it on the target page. I could make assumptions about common valve widget dimensions and styling, but that's not reliable. I should ask the user for the specific details of the valve1 widget so I can create an accurate copy."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26665, "output_tokens": 477, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14286.345400032587}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "ddb38c3b-208d-44b0-8e94-795b55410d50", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:e8b4dbe1adf3ba3946f56d539dd39a0d38160a460ad5d7e39ec33aae56470c3f", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-048", "text": "把source_page上的valve1复制到target_page，位置改到[300,120]，绑定保持VALVE_1_OPEN", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:19.946Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:40.288Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:19.946Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T05:40:40.288Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 26665, "output_tokens": 657, "latency_ms": 20296.81840003468, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "抱歉，当前工具集中**没有\"复制/克隆 widget\"的直接功能**，也没有\"查询单个 widget 详情\"的工具。\n\n要帮您完成这个操作，我需要手动在 `target_page` 上重新创建一个同款 widget 并绑定数据点。为此，我需要您补充以下信息：\n\n| 需要的信息 | 说明 |\n|-----------|------|\n| **widget 类型** | 例如 `valve`、`pump`、`tank` 等 |\n| **widget 尺寸 (size)** | 例如 `[80, 60]`（宽×高，像素） |\n| **样式（可选）** | 如颜色、线宽等，如果源 widget 有特殊样式 |\n\n另外，我需要确认：\n1. `target_page` 是否已经存在？（如果不存在我需要先创建）\n2. `VALVE_1_OPEN` 绑定的 widget **属性名**是什么？（常见的有 `value`、`status`、`open` 等）\n\n请您提供这些信息，我就可以帮您完成操作！", "reasoning": "The user wants to copy a widget called \"valve1\" from \"source_page\" to \"target_page\", with a new position [300,120], while keeping the binding to \"VALVE_1_OPEN\".\n\nLooking at my available tools, I don't see a direct \"copy_widget\" or \"clone_widget\" function. Let me think about how to achieve this:\n\n1. I don't have a copy/clone widget tool available\n2. I would need to manually recreate the widget on the target page\n\nTo do this, I first need to know the details of the existing widget on source_page - its type, size, style, and the property it's bound to. However, I don't have a \"get_widget_details\" or \"list_widgets\" tool either.\n\nLet me check what tools I have:\n- create_widget - to place a new widget\n- bind_point - to bind a point to a widget property\n- list_pages - list pages\n- But no tool to get widget details or list widgets on a page\n\nI should be transparent with the user that I don't have a direct \"copy widget\" capability, and I also don't have a way to query the existing widget's details (type, size, style). \n\nHowever, I can try to help by:\n1. First acknowledging that I need to know the widget's type and size from source_page\n2. Then creating a new widget on target_page with the specified position\n3. Then binding VALVE_1_OPEN to it\n\nBut I need to ask the user for the widget type and size since I can't query the existing widget.\n\nActually, wait - let me reconsider. The user said \"valve1\" which sounds like a valve widget. I could assume it's type \"valve\" but I don't know the size. I should ask the user for these details.\n\nLet me inform the user that I don't have a direct copy tool, and I need the widget's type and size to recreate it on the target page."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26665, "output_tokens": 657, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20341.959099983796}, "judge": null}
