r both of them. I can do this in parallel since they are independent operations."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27093, "output_tokens": 141, "latency_ms": 3658.666400006041, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个点的历史记录已成功启用。让我确认一下配置情况，然后导出历史数据：", "reasoning": "Both points now have history enabled. Let me verify by listing the history configuration, then query the history data for both tags."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 28133, "output_tokens": 427, "latency_ms": 7352.515299979132, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部完成！以下是汇总：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 历史记录配置结果\n\n| 点位 | 类型 | 采样模式 | 采样间隔 | 保留天数 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|----------|----------|------|\n| **P1** | 模拟量 (analog) | 周期采样 | 1秒 | 30天 | ✅ 已启用 |\n| **P2** | 数字量 (digital) | 周期采样 | 1秒 | 30天 | ✅ 已启用 |\n\n---\n\n## 📊 历史数据导出\n\n已查询最近 60 秒的数据（每个点 20 个采样）：\n\n### P1 历史数据\n| 时间偏移(s) | 值 |\n|------------|------|\n| 0 | -0.4087 |\n| 5 | 0.2891 |\n| 10 | 0.8455 |\n| 14 | 1.0000 |\n| 19 | 0.7502 |\n| ... | *(共20条)* |\n\n### P2 历史数据\n| 时间偏移(s) | 值 |\n|------------|------|\n| 0 | -0.2746 |\n| 5 | 0.4225 |\n| 10 | 0.9129 |\n| 14 | 1.0000 |\n| 19 | 0.6484 |\n| ... | *(共20条)* |\n\n---\n\n全厂所有 **2 个点位** 均已启用历史记录，并成功查询导出。如果需要调整采样间隔、保留天数，或导出更长时间窗口的数据，请告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Great, I have all the data now. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 108699, "output_tokens": 847, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20563.56969999615}, "judge": null}
