n the page.\n\nFor a tank widget, common properties would be:\n- value (for liquid level)\n- temperature\n- pressure\n\nLet me create the tank widget and then bind the three points."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27329, "output_tokens": 240, "latency_ms": 5909.734800000024, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体已创建，接下来将三个点位分别绑定到对应属性：", "reasoning": "The tank widget was created successfully. Now I need to bind the three points to the tank widget. I'll bind:\n- LT_01 → value (liquid level)\n- TT_01 → temperature\n- PT_01 → pressure"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 27679, "output_tokens": 198, "latency_ms": 5876.468100000011, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 全部完成！在 **化工面板（chem_panel）** 上已创建罐体并绑定点位，汇总如下：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **控件** | `tank_01`（罐体），位于 (400, 200)，尺寸 250×400 |\n| **液位** | `tank_01.value` ← `LT_01`（m） |\n| **温度** | `tank_01.temperature` ← `TT_01`（°C） |\n| **压力** | `tank_01.pressure` ← `PT_01`（MPa） |\n\n运行时，罐体将实时显示液位高度、温度和压力数值。如需调整位置、大小或样式，请随时告诉我！", "reasoning": "All three bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 108687, "output_tokens": 875, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24637.238399999886}, "judge": null}
